# Measures the budgets from the roadmap on a 100k-line file. Prints results rather than asserting,
# since they depend on the machine and the build profile.
open {dir}/big.rs
wait-parsed
expect-highlights
do MoveDocStart
scroll-bench 300
do MoveDocEnd
wait-parsed
type-bench 100
wait-parsed
screenshot {shots}/08-big-file.png
